  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PRQA 03 · Prompt Builder (LLM)\nThe worker renders the chat-completion request from `prompts/llm/*.v2.md` + the canonical reference prompt (`prompts/reference/Senior_QA_Reference_Prompt.md`) + the sanitized context. The prompt LLM (active provider: direct Groq `openai/gpt-oss-120b`, no OpenRouter fallback) rewrites the reference for this PR. n8n holds no provider key: a real request goes to the **model proxy** (`prqa-model-proxy:8089`, prompt credential PRQA_MODEL_PROXY_PROMPT_TOKEN, shared provider budget, no tools); without the credential no request is sent. The output is validated (structure, required sections, no secrets, no injected phrases); on any failure or rejection the **deterministic reference-derived fallback** is used. The OpenCode result contract (section 15) is always appended by the worker.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "26a32016-6c9e-52a4-bfea-c911d51fbfd9",
      "name": "Note 1",
